Notifications (disk health, btrfs errors, failed scrubs, image updates) go to ntfy.
Create /etc/nas-argon-eon/ntfy.env on the machine (not in the image: the token is a
secret), mode 0600:

NTFY_URL=https://ntfy.thomelab.net
NTFY_TOPIC=<topic>
NTFY_TOKEN=<token>

Test with: sudo /usr/libexec/nas-argon-eon/notify test "hello from $(hostname)"
